{title: I know God is God}
{x_theme: holy-spirit}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/I know God is God.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
I know God is God, and God don’t ever change
I know God is God, and Jesus is His name

{comment: Verse 1}
You can read it in your Bible,
Search it through and through
You will find there’s only one God,
You can’t find the other two

{comment: Verse 2}
He’s God on the platform,
He’s God back at the door
He’s God in the Amen corner,
He’s God all over this floor

{comment: Verse 3}
He’s God in Oklahoma,
He’s God in Tennessee
He’s God in Arizona,
He’s God in you and me

{comment: Verse 4}
They call us Holy rollers,
They’re always making fun
But when you get this Holy Ghost,
You’ll speak in other tongues.
